# A web service an agent started (e2e/fake: serve: job_start with a port), its page from the chat's jobs: the page
# drawn by a web view whose every request goes through the core to the station (station.preview: its HTML, its
# stylesheet, what its script fetches), where it is typed in the bar (b.html), back in the page's own history.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap 发消息
type 开个网页 {T} serve:e2e-web|18978|网页开好了 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
untiln 2 网页开好了 {T}
tap icon:web
until 服务
shot 1-jobs
tap 在线
until 自适应
timeout 60000
shot 2-page
tap icon:web
clear
type /b.html
enter
# (the page's own navigation in the web view, which the app does not await: the host's)
wait 4000
shot 3-second
tap icon:arrow-left
# (the same, back in its history)
wait 3000
shot 4-back
tap 手机
# (the page laid out again by the web view at a phone's width and its picture taken again: the host's own)
wait 3000
shot 5-phone
back
until 网页开好了 {T}
